belirli tipte lineer olmayan diferansiyel denklemleri \u231  \u246  zebilme\line 3. Lineer denklem \u231  \u246  z\u252  mleri i\u231  in varl\u305  k ve teklik ko\u351  ullar\u305  n\u305   anlayabilme.\line 4. \u304  kinci ve daha y\u252  ksek mertebeden sabit katsay\u305  l\u305   lineer denklemler i\u231  in \u231  \u246  z\u252  m bulabilme.\line 5. \u304  kinci mertebeden lineer denklemler i\u231  in adi ve d\u252  zg\u252  n tekil noktalar etraf\u305  nda  seri \u231  \u246  z\u252  mler bulabilme.\line 6. Laplace d\u246  n\u252  \u351  \u252  m\u252   kullanarak ilk de\u287  er problemleri \u231  \u246  zebilme.\line 7. Lineer denklem sistemlerini lineer cebir metodlar\u305  yla \u231  \u246  zebilme.\par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy6823\absw9300\absh-391\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\brdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\cbpat0\cf1\b\f0\fs19 Dersin Amac\u305  \par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy8127\absw9300\absh-391\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\brdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\cbpat0\cf1\b\f0\fs19 \u214  \u287  renme \u199  \u305  kt\u305  lar\u305  \par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy5714\absw9300\absh-391\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\brdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\cbpat0\cf1\b\f0\fs19 Dersin K\u305  sa \u304  \u231  eri\u287  i\par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy10689\absw9300\absh-391\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\brdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\cbpat0\cf1\f0\fs19 Midterms (%40) Final (%60)\par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy10298\absw9300\absh-391\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\brdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1\brsp28\cbpat0\cf1\b\f0\fs19 De\u287  erlendirme Kriteri\par}{\pard\overlay\posx30\posy11652\absw9300\absh-718\frmtxlrtb\pvpg\ql\li28\ri28\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf1